structural leak checks acknowledged by all 2 data nodes
Fault matrix: every run failed as expected or returned the reference result, nothing leaked
DROP TEMPORARY TABLE spj_faults, spj_fail;
DROP VIEW spj_robust_dih_scans, spj_robust_frag_scans;
DROP TABLE t1, t2, t3;
